{"title":"Sam Vandervelde","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Sam Vandervelde</b> is one of the founders of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mandelbrot_Competition\" title=\"Mandelbrot Competition\">Mandelbrot Competition</a> and ran the competition until its completion in 2019.  He is also an instructor for the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Worldwide_Online_Olympiad_Training\" title=\"Worldwide Online Olympiad Training\">Worldwide Online Olympiad Training</a> (WOOT) program.  He was an <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IMO\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"IMO\">IMO</a> silver medalist, a 2-time winner of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=USAMO\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"USAMO\">USAMO</a>, a perfect scorer on the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AIME\">AIME</a>, and a top-10 participant at National <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MATHCOUNTS\" title=\"MATHCOUNTS\">MATHCOUNTS</a>.  He is now the head and a teacher of Proof School, a school with the aim of supporting kids who love math.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018105815\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.004 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.005 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 1/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:2158:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018105815 and revision id 251997. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}